  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
package kokkos
package kokkos newton off neigh full comm device
units lj
atom_style sphere
boundary p p p

lattice fcc 0.8
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 1.7099759 1.7099759 1.7099759
region box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box 1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (13.679808 13.679808 13.679808)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 2048 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (13.679808 13.679808 13.679808)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.004 seconds

set type 1 diameter 1.0
Setting atom values ...
  2048 settings made for diameter
set type 1 density 1.0
Setting atom values ...
  2048 settings made for density

pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5

velocity all create 1.0 12345 dist gaussian

compute T_sp all temp/sphere
compute T_tr all temp

thermo_style custom step temp c_T_sp c_T_tr ke
thermo 100

fix fnve  all nve/sphere
fix flang all langevin 1.0 1.0 1.0 12345 omega yes

run 2000

